      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No, don't rub your eye aggressively with a cloth, as this can further irritate it and potentially cause damage. Instead, flush your eye with water right away to remove the degreaser. If the burning persists, use the chamomile eye drops you have, but if the discomfort continues or vision is blurry, seek medical attention immediately.",
